=== WHAT IS NOT CLAIMED HERE ===
This is a START, not a completion. Step 6 (bs4_completed.out and the report to 0.0.0_AB_MSTR~DELL1) is
owed only on the driver's own PAIRS completion line, and the leg has 107 pairs to attempt at a 15s
minimum pace. The previous session's failure mode was a collector LAUNCH failure (rc 0xC0000142) that
produced `run_id=None`, so the first JOB line carrying a real run_id is what will show the condition
has actually cleared; at this read no JOB line has been printed yet. Step 5's re-declaration before the
48-hour marker lapses is owed if it runs that long.
